", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们在《层（Sheaves）》第<REF_0001>节定义了基（basis）上的层（sheaf）的概念，并证明这一概念本质上等价（equivalent）于空间（space）上的层（sheaf）的概念，见《层（Sheaves）》引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>。此外，我们在《层（Sheaves）》引理<REF_0004>中证明，层条件（sheaf condition）对每个标准开集（standard open）只需在一个共尾（cofinal）的开覆盖（coverings）系上检验。由上面的引理，只需在由标准开集（standard opens）组成的有限（finite）覆盖（coverings）上检验。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:bcaafde7efa5eb755873ad88daebc7715a6861b0f38fd7ec8e5c177d17b63bc3", "unit_id": "tag:01M3:prose-0002", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所引章节的名称", "source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "定义层所依托的拓扑基", "source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"context": "基上的层", "source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "比较两种层的概念", "source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "另一种层所定义于其上的空间", "source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"context": "空间上的层", "source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "所引章节的名称", "source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "所引章节的名称", "source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "需对覆盖检验的层条件", "source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"context": "逐一检验层条件的对象", "source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"context": "限定所检验的开覆盖系", "source_term": "cofinal", "target_term": "共尾"}, {"context": "此处由原文 open 限定为开覆盖", "source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"context": "组成有限覆盖的开集", "source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"context": "限定所需检验的覆盖为有限覆盖", "source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"context": "由标准开集组成的有限覆盖", "source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}]}
